name    mod-dungeon-challenge: boss adds at challenge level 100 carry the run's health
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. The level-100 sibling of dc_scaling_holes: Utgarde Keep (heroic) at
# the highest level (health x6.0, damage x3.0 with the workbench's 5 % / 2 % per level). Keleseth's five Vrykul
# Skeletons (23970, 4383-4534 health unscaled) must come out at 26298-27204: the check is > 20000; Keleseth himself
# (heroic 30748, 417056 unscaled) at > 2000000. The director pulls in `.cheat god`; level 100 is option 25 of the
# NPC's stepped list (1, 4, 8, ..., 100).
timeout 180s

bot a warrior
group party

place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
require a alive
pick stone creature:500000 near a
require stone exists
do a approach stone
do a gossip stone
expect output has "Start Dungeon Challenge"
do a select 0
expect output has "Utgarde Keep"
do a select 0
expect output has "Level 100"
do a select 25
do a select 0
waitfor a map 574 timeout 20s
waitfor gm map 574 timeout 20s
wait 2s

log 1 - boss adds are scaled
as gm .cheat god on
pick kel creature:23953 near gm
require kel exists
do gm goto 183.0 199.0 40.9
do gm approach kel
do gm attack kel
waitfor kel incombat timeout 10s
wait 7s
pick skel creature:23970 near gm
require skel exists
do gm target skel
as gm .npc info
expect skel maxhealth > 20000
expect kel maxhealth > 2000000

cleanup
as gm .cheat god off
place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
